{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>日本前AV女優三上悠亞2025年在Instagram分享一組婚紗照，意外引發網路風波。</p><p>1名日本新婚人妻當時發文批評，自己租借拍攝婚紗照的禮服竟曾被三上悠亞穿過，直呼「被AV女優穿了，整個好難過」，甚至揚言若早知道便不會租借。此番帶有職業歧視意味的言論，引發兩派網友激烈論戰。</p><figure><img alt=\"日本人妻發文嫌棄婚紗被三上悠亞（圖）穿過，卻被網友反挖出疑似曾拍過無碼片。（圖／翻攝自IG／yua_mikami）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260524/1135321457362997248871694.jpeg/Bxjvav84NETOc0cGirfCUO3_3l7kOhAUGUAUABlAFAA\"/><figcaption>日本人妻發文嫌棄婚紗被三上悠亞（圖）穿過，卻被網友反挖出疑似曾拍過無碼片。（圖／翻攝自IG／yua_mikami）</figcaption></figure><p>相關文章：日本人妻租婚紗　發現三上悠亞曾穿過　網上吐苦水遭批職業歧視</p><figure><img alt=\"【相關文章：日本人妻租婚紗　發現三上悠亞曾穿過　網上吐苦水遭批職業歧視】日本一位20多歲的新婚人妻，為了拍婚紗照租下心愛的婚紗，沒想到發現婚紗被前AV女優三上悠亞穿過了。圖為事主。（X/ @nou_beau）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250728/1026467025989406720598120.jpeg/Om0sNQHcUloWoZh1_7gAPj79-4ABGPhUXtqupV7arqU\"/><figcaption>【相關文章：日本人妻租婚紗　發現三上悠亞曾穿過　網上吐苦水遭批職業歧視】日本一位20多歲的新婚人妻，為了拍婚紗照租下心愛的婚紗，沒想到發現婚紗被前AV女優三上悠亞穿過了。圖為事主。（X/ @nou_beau）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"日本一位20多歲的新婚人妻，為了拍婚紗照租下心愛的婚紗，沒想到發現婚紗被前AV女優三上悠亞穿過了。圖為事主。（X/ @nou_beau）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250728/1026467028707446784153406.jpeg/9rB9J6_c5Lx7W6gh7iwmA277zmW477iCDS5rJQ0uayU\"/><figcaption>日本一位20多歲的新婚人妻，為了拍婚紗照租下心愛的婚紗，沒想到發現婚紗被前AV女優三上悠亞穿過了。圖為事主。（X/ @nou_beau）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"新婚女事主租下心愛婚紗，發現三上悠亞穿過了，沮喪發文：「早知道會借給AV女優，我就不會簽約。」（X截圖/ @nou_beau）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250728/1026467031404515328261805.png/iBXMiR7agENXWozLcbiNCgNAcBeSQWvfh3sHcYd7B3E\"/><figcaption>新婚女事主租下心愛婚紗，發現三上悠亞穿過了，沮喪發文：「早知道會借給AV女優，我就不會簽約。」（X截圖/ @nou_beau）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"三上悠亞穿婚紗的美照意外捲入日網炎上話題。（Instagram / @yua_mikami）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250728/1026469124718465024328174.jpeg/TGG-cnoETcVKwj-hWTbEhvWaYiyvjX_w3vapB972qQc\"/><figcaption>三上悠亞穿婚紗的美照意外捲入日網炎上話題。（Instagram / @yua_mikami）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"三上悠亞穿婚紗的美照意外捲入日網炎上話題。（Instagram / @yua_mikami）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250728/1026469127084183552351274.jpeg/Nqy7ZjhtKSXmCvK59diYMhTEanUP-CRJnM0SOpzNEjo\"/><figcaption>三上悠亞穿婚紗的美照意外捲入日網炎上話題。（Instagram / @yua_mikami）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"三上悠亞穿婚紗的美照意外捲入日網炎上話題。（Instagram / @yua_mikami）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250728/1026469129307295744478165.jpeg/AwgUwnBE4AfpTt5GEYXiowXwWWlYIl7HYjm4rGI5uKw\"/><figcaption>三上悠亞穿婚紗的美照意外捲入日網炎上話題。（Instagram / @yua_mikami）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"三上悠亞穿婚紗的美照意外捲入日網炎上話題。（Instagram / @yua_mikami）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250728/1026469131652042752054731.jpeg/Kdg0nrjW5fi77v61AmKojLORgED8TfWkz3kJJM95CSQ\"/><figcaption>三上悠亞穿婚紗的美照意外捲入日網炎上話題。（Instagram / @yua_mikami）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"女事主反擊網友批評：「誰會想到婚紗專門店會把禮服借給AV女優啊？」（X截圖/ @nou_beau）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250728/1026467033979949056462913.png/B_QVgCXe0lcsZMZJKro3S6mu4ZolLVEh9hmsH_YZrB8\"/><figcaption>女事主反擊網友批評：「誰會想到婚紗專門店會把禮服借給AV女優啊？」（X截圖/ @nou_beau）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"女事主持續哭訴覺得很糟糕，要與老公商量後續怎麼辦。（X截圖/ @nou_beau）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250728/1026467036123369472601384.png/8ffuquwCtQBdq8blALb9wv5fPkv8DlfEKU5rsylOa7M\"/><figcaption>女事主持續哭訴覺得很糟糕，要與老公商量後續怎麼辦。（X截圖/ @nou_beau）</figcaption></figure><p>然而事件卻在近日迎來出乎意料的大反轉。有日本網友循線找到1部2017年在FC2平台流傳的無碼作品，標榜由「18歲女大生」演出。大批鄉民以高畫質雙視窗比對後，震驚發現影片中女主角的五官與臉部輪廓，與當初批評三上悠亞的人妻「高達99%相似」，懷疑根本是同一人。</p><p>消息一出，該名人妻的社群帳號旋即「光速」消失，令網友大呼反轉劇情過於精彩。台灣AV評論人「一劍浣春秋」分析指出，由於影片女主角全程穿著學生制服，除外貌高度神似外，缺乏其他可供比對的身體特徵，加上當事人帳號已無從查詢本人回應，暫時無法百分之百確認兩人是否為同一人。</p><figure><img alt=\"【延伸閱讀：AV女優疑流出「無碼片」遭網瘋傳　本人回應：是私人影片已告律師】繪戀空（IG@erensora_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260122/1090967434430517248625037.jpeg/t1GJAbkTIFi1TvRXvWPIL7CH0COR5C6USb_s_Um_7P0\"/><figcaption>【延伸閱讀：AV女優疑流出「無碼片」遭網瘋傳　本人回應：是私人影片已告律師】繪戀空（IG@erensora_official）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"日本AV女優繪戀空（絵恋空）近日捲入「無碼片」爭議，網路上流傳她過去曾拍攝無碼作品，引發熱議。（IG@erensora_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260122/1090967993883693056453891.jpeg/lxWNw6pBkPrphdZlO7FUqKCH9rT6n7XYsWdW5bFnVuU\"/><figcaption>日本AV女優繪戀空（絵恋空）近日捲入「無碼片」爭議，網路上流傳她過去曾拍攝無碼作品，引發熱議。（IG@erensora_official）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"對此，繪戀空20日發表正式聲明嚴正否認，強調相關影像並非作品，而是遭第三者非法流出的私人影片，目前已委請律師處理，呼籲外界勿再以訛傳訛。（IG@erensora_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260122/1090967997847441408295610.jpeg/LXoxVeM4rSmdLAGBvyBYrDgUPNmguC7PTFzbTExc20w\"/><figcaption>對此，繪戀空20日發表正式聲明嚴正否認，強調相關影像並非作品，而是遭第三者非法流出的私人影片，目前已委請律師處理，呼籲外界勿再以訛傳訛。（IG@erensora_official）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"繪戀空在聲明中指出，近期網路流傳的無碼影片與其AV女優身分無關，並澄清自己在正式出道前，從未從事過相關拍攝或活動。（IG@erensora_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260122/1090967993300553728265017.jpeg/ifboEXuqWxnHKw8bHY0jXx-D5YS9anEiWCaHmFgmh5g\"/><figcaption>繪戀空在聲明中指出，近期網路流傳的無碼影片與其AV女優身分無關，並澄清自己在正式出道前，從未從事過相關拍攝或活動。（IG@erensora_official）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"她強調，該影片屬於私人影像，卻遭人惡意外流，已嚴重侵害個人權益與名譽。（IG@erensora_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260122/1090967995548831744504613.jpeg/ifezAErrbUjC8vF9JjEJHbHp219DNlXttN6LtLTei7Q\"/><figcaption>她強調，該影片屬於私人影像，卻遭人惡意外流，已嚴重侵害個人權益與名譽。（IG@erensora_official）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"繪戀空（IG@erensora_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260122/1090967991555723264247681.jpeg/pOzDL7SnuwVTNAVDpUDTZcT60qc7mQ64LS_i3S0v4t0\"/><figcaption>繪戀空（IG@erensora_official）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"繪戀空（IG@erensora_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260122/1090968005212901376534926.jpeg/O-iAl5cn-Ow67xt-WyTDTXQ1tTltiaeEMgJvUTICb1E\"/><figcaption>繪戀空（IG@erensora_official）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"繪戀空（IG@erensora_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260122/1090967999550328832328641.jpeg/wlRq7nBomt4iMutFcCAd-WAXjcXphIbSFKKm8BSipvA\"/><figcaption>繪戀空（IG@erensora_official）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"繪戀空（IG@erensora_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260122/1090968001488228352065842.jpeg/MJmv8_bW9ko3CdDaHFWJrK_WNDtp_vwlWFgnTVhYJ00\"/><figcaption>繪戀空（IG@erensora_official）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"繪戀空（IG@erensora_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260122/1090967994873417728621045.jpeg/WDIyDNxPrz1NdOrUGdC3_Jcb99whI-i4yXFnA8lxZwM\"/><figcaption>繪戀空（IG@erensora_official）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"繪戀空（IG@erensora_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260122/1090967995368345600315079.jpeg/40Ze2pIwFBKD3ySzu0byit7nXgHAfltT2m-ur9pvrq8\"/><figcaption>繪戀空（IG@erensora_official）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"繪戀空（IG@erensora_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260122/1090967996660322304417930.jpeg/v5Ds8Uh7ZDGH9jeb3s9QlWSYLkgmn3VUa3kO52t5Duc\"/><figcaption>繪戀空（IG@erensora_official）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"繪戀空（IG@erensora_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260122/1090967997331410944827046.jpeg/YIKf5f7NX-HqmR4zhSnhTEQQeHNKf875vqlSG76pUhs\"/><figcaption>繪戀空（IG@erensora_official）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"繪戀空（IG@erensora_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260122/1090968000112496640428679.jpeg/5EY1d98C3ZID7chgJO6krBwziTg8rxXSGHuc6xh7nOs\"/><figcaption>繪戀空（IG@erensora_official）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"繪戀空（IG@erensora_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260122/1090968002570489856298310.jpeg/yDH1GLQxn8ysuikN6VdYJnIgsjVnQZg005kCr9OZAq8\"/><figcaption>繪戀空（IG@erensora_official）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"繪戀空（IG@erensora_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260122/1090968002985594880938015.jpeg/BQA0GKyDjD_5qkM0rzURAWLRcGa-T6sSPuAE_z7gBP8\"/><figcaption>繪戀空（IG@erensora_official）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"繪戀空（IG@erensora_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260122/1090968002637467648582641.jpeg/GdsCuw79jGJ9vVGauJB8KKvG4Lq64pMXwepvjMHqb4w\"/><figcaption>繪戀空（IG@erensora_official）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"繪戀空（IG@erensora_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260122/1090968004806053888038925.jpeg/WGA9uzRaKes3QYu5YBTAoPQS7C2lzhzCNMsPCTTLDwk\"/><figcaption>繪戀空（IG@erensora_official）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"繪戀空（IG@erensora_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260122/1090967997788590080276189.jpeg/j1dD_IH4cNGHTn0iIKZCCOS4jsM0o6KgAny2JwJ8tic\"/><figcaption>繪戀空（IG@erensora_official）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"繪戀空（IG@erensora_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260122/1090967994210717696947213.jpeg/YWLfeWznhpZDkfsUQS9h-6es0lXj1FpT21xNZ9tcTWc\"/><figcaption>繪戀空（IG@erensora_official）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"繪戀空（IG@erensora_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260122/1090967999822958592043218.jpeg/mKnm0DzL1UESwOI-XuBi_zdwxIt0AU-4WQ5nplkOZ6Y\"/><figcaption>繪戀空（IG@erensora_official）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"繪戀空（IG@erensora_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260122/1090967998870851584264951.jpeg/YHkDe8K4N4u_Lxr4zDhmwnmtJBtHkUXgrF8ShKxfEoQ\"/><figcaption>繪戀空（IG@erensora_official）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"繪戀空（IG@erensora_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260122/1090968003937832960187932.jpeg/UivoGqbkY_qqoFNeAqZqtH4RAOqtvbqzrYaNoq2GjaI\"/><figcaption>繪戀空（IG@erensora_official）</figcaption></figure><p>【本文獲「引新聞」授權轉載】</p><p>本文內容反映原文作者的意見，並不代表《香港01》的立場。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-26T04:19:20.319132+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1885,"images":33,"source":"HK01 熱話","fallback":"none"}}